{{Quote|Sir, three unidentified starships have just entered our sector.|An Imperial officer to [[Lieutenant]] [[Yogar Lyste|Lyste]]|<ref name="A Princess on Lothal" />}}
The '''Lothal sector''' was a [[sector]] located in [[the galaxy]]'s [[Outer Rim Territories]] that contained the [[Lothal system|Lothal]] and [[Garel system|Garel]] [[star system]]s,<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" /> as well as the [[planet]]s [[Oon]]<ref name="Return of the Slavers">{{RebelsMagCite|5|Return of the Slavers}}</ref> and [[Atollon]].<ref name="Atollon Note" /> During the [[Imperial Era|reign]] of the [[Galactic Empire]], the sector was [[Governor|governed]] by [[Arihnda Pryce]]<ref name="DB Pryce">{{Databank|governor-pryce|Governor Pryce}}</ref> of [[Lothal]]<ref name="Thrawn">[[Thrawn (novel)|''Thrawn'']]</ref> and [[Moff]] [[Stattata]].<ref name="Rebel Files">''[[Star Wars: The Rebel Files]]''</ref> It bordered the [[Calamari sector]].<ref name="Galactic Atlas">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]''</ref>

